# capability-composer live probe credentials (copy to .env — NEVER commit)
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   # then fill in the real keys. .env is gitignored.
#
# The live probe (scripts/live_probe.py) is OPT-IN: without a key it stays
# inert (exit 0, nothing attempted, sandbox stays the verified path). With a
# key it makes EXACTLY ONE read-only call against the real API and writes a
# §8 evidence artifact to evidence/live/ (content-addressed, polarity
# SUPPORTING on success / CONTRADICTING on failure).
#
# Where each key comes from:
#   GHL_API_KEY       GoHighLevel — Location API key (Settings > API Access)
#   HUBSPOT_API_KEY   HubSpot — Private App access token (Settings > Integrations
#                     > Private Apps); needs contacts+deals read scopes
#   SLACK_API_KEY     Slack — Bot token (xoxb-...) from your app's
#                     OAuth & Permissions page; needs channels:read, users:read
#
# Run (reads the real APIs once each, READ-ONLY — never creates/updates):
#   set -a; source .env; set +a
#   python scripts/live_probe.py
#
# Then feed the artifacts into the verification ledger:
#   skill-os replay-events   # (or the consumer directly — see the
#                            #  sovereign-verification SKILL.md)
GHL_API_KEY=
HUBSPOT_API_KEY=
SLACK_API_KEY=
